sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as LAN client
  participant DNS as AdGuard Home
  participant NPM as Nginx Proxy Manager
  participant Service as Internal service

  Client->>DNS: Resolve home.yuu.lan
  DNS-->>Client: Return internal proxy address
  Client->>NPM: Request home.yuu.lan
  NPM->>Service: Proxy to internal service
  Service-->>NPM: Response
  NPM-->>Client: Response
